bee@ms.uky.edu (Elizabeth Gilliam) writes:
>Is there any benefit for having more than one blessed luckstone?
>Does a cursed luckstone do anything bad, esp. if you also
>have a blessed one?  Maybe someone can send me some kind
>of probability chart?

You only get a +3 luck bonus if you carry one or more blessed luckstones.
And, of course, good luck won't time out.
(I just tried it.)

You only get a -3 luck bonus if you carry one or more cursed luckstones.
And of course, bad luck won't time out.
(Again, I'm sure, just tried it.)

If you carry both types of luckstones, both good and bad luck won't time
out. But...

...you still get a +3 luck bonus!!!  The cursed luck stone does *not* negate
the blessed one.
(Just tried this one, too.)

